      "name": "Sales",
      "description": "Sales context. PostgreSQL + EF Core. Every endpoint requires a token. A Customer is scoped to their own sales; a Manager or Admin sees every sale.\n\nDomain failures come back as `{ type, error, detail }` with a `Sales.*` type. Business rejections are 422, state conflicts are 409.",
