      "parentId": "grp_sales",
      "name": "POST Create sale (checkout)",
      "description": "Turns a cart into a sale and checks the cart out in the same transaction. Prices, titles, discounts and totals are never accepted from the client — they are read from the catalog and computed by the discount policy (4-9 units: 10%, 10-20 units: 20%, under 4: none, over 20: rejected).\n\nThe customer comes from the token. The branch is resolved from the seeded `Branches` configuration section.\n\n201 created (Location header), body is the full sale\n400 `cartId` or `branchId` missing\n409 `Sales.CartAlreadyCheckedOut`\n422 `Sales.UnknownBranch`, `Sales.UnknownCart` (also a cart owned by someone else), `Sales.EmptyCart`, `Sales.UnknownProduct`, `Sales.QuantityExceeded`, `Sales.Rejected`",
      "method": "POST",
